  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="22.1a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 22.1a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ofga mán anfealde láde mid anfealde foraðe ⁊ ðrifealde lade mid ðrifealdan foraðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In cases where a simple oath of exculpation is involved, the case shall be begun with a simple oath of accusation, but where a triple oath of exculpation is involved, it shall be begun with a triple oath of accusation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And ofgá man anfealde lade mid anfealdan foraðe ⁊ þryfealde lade mid þryfealdan foraðe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
